ing and he hits his  head  on a concrete pillar and it kills him  now lamar  was a good man he was simply an innocent  bystander  in all of this a person trying to be  good and everybody knows that  including the flag smashers which is why  when he dies they run  and they realize the severity of what  just happened lamar was famous he was  the sidekick of the new captain america  he was battle star  and even though i did predict that he  was going to die in a video i did  yesterday i'm really sad about this i  actually liked his character he kept  john walker in check which  is going to be a problem now that he's  gone as we can see by the very  last scene in this episode john walker  loses it  but i don't blame him they essentially  just killed his best friend  and now with super soldier serum pumping  through his veins  he runs after the flag smashers he jumps  through the window  does a superhero landing on top of a car  and although it was carly that killed  lamar  nico was the first flag smasher that  john walker caught up to throwing the  shield at him  knocking him to the ground in which he  screams it wasn't me  and john walker knows that it wasn't him  he even says where is she but he doesn't  care because he's in a rage  with nico on the ground he starts to  throw the shield at him even more  knocking him back even more until  eventually  he raises the shield just like captain  america did to iron man and captain  america civil war  although instead of just going for the  ark reactor to depower iron man's suit  john walker in this case bashes nico  until he kills him he straight up  brutally murders him in front of a lot  of people who are all recording on their  phones  everything that just happened so  essentially the whole entire  world is about to see the new captain  america brutally and viciously murder  somebody  so what happens from here well john  walker is most likely not going to be  able to remain being captain america  the us government will m